<title>NETHERLANDS: Reed-Elsevier says buy ups profit.</title>
<headline>Reed-Elsevier says buy ups profit.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch publishing group Reed-Elsevier said on Wednesday its acquisition of some 40 U.S. legal publications from Thomson Corp would immediately enhance its earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;We can say that this is profit-enhancing from the start,&quot; Elsevier's deputy chairman Paul Vlek told Reuters.</p>
</text>
